WEBVTT

00:09.172 --> 00:10.517
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.586 --> 00:12.137
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.206 --> 00:13.655
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.724 --> 00:15.758
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.827 --> 00:18.758
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:18.827 --> 00:20.758
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.827 --> 00:22.827
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:22.896 --> 00:24.655
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.724 --> 00:26.586
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:26.655 --> 00:28.793
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:28.862 --> 00:30.862
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:30.931 --> 00:32.758
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.827 --> 00:34.758
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:34.827 --> 00:36.586
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:36.655 --> 00:38.896
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.965 --> 00:40.758
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:40.827 --> 00:42.137
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:42.206 --> 00:43.965
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:44.034 --> 00:46.689
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.758 --> 00:49.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:49.068 --> 00:50.689
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:52.689 --> 00:55.586
[spooky music]
[诡异的音乐]

00:55.655 --> 01:02.689
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:02.758 --> 01:04.379
[thunder booms]
[雷霆轰鸣]

01:04.448 --> 01:06.551
- [panting, whimpering]
- [气喘吁吁，呜咽]

01:06.620 --> 01:09.344
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

01:09.413 --> 01:11.793
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:11.862 --> 01:13.068
[doorknob rattling]
[门把手嘎嘎作响]

01:13.137 --> 01:15.862
[loud thunking]
[重击声]

01:15.931 --> 01:17.655
[screams]
- Grandma!
[尖叫声]
- 奶奶！

01:17.724 --> 01:20.103
No!
[screams]
不！
[尖叫声]

01:20.172 --> 01:23.241
- [laughs]
Get her, Grandma!
- [笑]
抓住她，奶奶！

01:23.310 --> 01:24.758
[laughs, yelps]
[笑声，尖叫声]

01:24.827 --> 01:26.310
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:26.379 --> 01:29.206
I'm the ghost of Plankton!
我是浮游生物的幽灵！

01:29.275 --> 01:31.758
Wooo!
[yelps]
呜呜！
[尖叫声]

01:31.827 --> 01:33.310
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:33.379 --> 01:35.551
Hey, that gives me an idea.
嘿，这给了我一个主意。

01:35.620 --> 01:37.517
[grunts]
[bright music]
[咕哝]
[明亮的音乐]

01:37.586 --> 01:39.551
[Karen buzzes]
[babbles]
[凯伦嗡嗡声]
[胡言乱语]

01:39.620 --> 01:42.586
Hmm, if I were a ghost,
嗯，如果我是鬼，

01:42.655 --> 01:45.413
I could walk right through
the walls of the Krusty Krab
我可以直接走过
蟹堡王的墙壁

01:45.482 --> 01:47.965
and take the Krabby Patty
secret formula!
吃蟹肉饼
秘密配方！

01:48.034 --> 01:49.172
[giggles]
- Ah!
[咯咯笑]
- 啊！

01:49.241 --> 01:50.655
All right, that's it.
好吧，就是这样。

01:50.724 --> 01:52.379
You ruined another movie night
你又毁了一个电影之夜

01:52.448 --> 01:53.931
with your
secret formula garbage.
与你的
秘方垃圾。

01:54.000 --> 01:55.482
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

01:55.551 --> 01:58.068
- I'm pulling the plug.
[whirrs down]
- 我要拔掉插头了
[呼啸而下]

01:58.137 --> 02:01.448
- [groans] Ah.
Let's see.
- [呻吟]啊。
让我们来看看。

02:01.517 --> 02:05.137
Now all I need to do
is invent a...
现在我需要做的就是
是发明一个...

02:05.206 --> 02:09.068
[grunts]
Ghost extracting machine!
[咕哝]
鬼魂提取机！

02:09.137 --> 02:10.931
[laughs, grunts]
[笑声，咕哝声]

02:11.000 --> 02:12.758
[machine blipping, rattling]
[机器发出声音、嘎嘎声]

02:12.827 --> 02:14.655
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

02:14.724 --> 02:16.827
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:16.896 --> 02:20.413
[screaming]
[尖叫]

02:20.482 --> 02:22.620
[eerie music]
[诡异的音乐]

02:22.689 --> 02:23.793
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:23.862 --> 02:25.000
[whistles]
[口哨声]

02:25.068 --> 02:27.275
I look like I just saw a ghost.
我看起来就像刚刚看到鬼一样。

02:27.344 --> 02:29.827
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:29.896 --> 02:33.068
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

02:33.137 --> 02:35.482
[laughs]
Success!
[笑]
成功了！

02:37.931 --> 02:39.103
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

02:39.172 --> 02:42.275
[laughs giddily]
[笑得眼花缭乱]

02:43.379 --> 02:46.344
[hums, laughs]
[哼哼，大笑]

02:47.793 --> 02:51.172
You gotta give up the ghost
if you wanna make toast.
你必须放弃幽灵
如果你想做吐司。

02:51.241 --> 02:53.655
[grunts]
What?
[咕哝]
什么？

02:53.724 --> 02:56.068
No, no, no!
不，不，不！

02:56.137 --> 02:58.689
Stupid ghost hands!
愚蠢的鬼手！

02:58.758 --> 03:01.034
[sobs]
[抽泣]

03:01.103 --> 03:03.655
- [cackles maniacally]
- [疯狂地咯咯笑]

03:03.724 --> 03:04.896
- What?
- 什么？

03:04.965 --> 03:06.103
- [laughing hysterically]
- [歇斯底里地大笑]

03:06.172 --> 03:08.344
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

03:08.413 --> 03:10.413
[laughing continues]
[笑声继续]

03:10.482 --> 03:13.448
- What's so funny?
Stupid ghost!
- 有什么好笑的？
愚蠢的鬼！

03:13.517 --> 03:15.551
- You are, that's what.
- 你是，就是这样。

03:15.620 --> 03:18.931
You can't just float in
on your first day
你不能只是漂浮在
在你的第一天

03:19.000 --> 03:20.655
and pick things up.
并捡起东西。

03:20.724 --> 03:22.862
[laughs]
[笑]

03:22.931 --> 03:24.206
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

03:24.275 --> 03:26.551
[chuckles]
[笑声]

03:26.620 --> 03:28.620
Here you go.
Oh, grab it.
干得好。
哦，抓住它。

03:28.689 --> 03:30.517
Grab it!
Get it! [laughs]
抓住它！
得到它！ [笑]

03:30.586 --> 03:32.689
- I can't grab it!
- 我抓不到它！

03:32.758 --> 03:34.310
[wheezes]
[喘息声]

03:34.379 --> 03:36.172
- I like you, squirt.
- 我喜欢你，喷。

03:36.241 --> 03:39.793
I got a soft spot
in me dead heart for thieves.
我有一个柔软的地方
我对盗贼已经死心了。

03:40.758 --> 03:42.310
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

03:42.379 --> 03:44.448
- I can teach you
how to pick things up.
- 我可以教你
如何拾取东西。

03:44.517 --> 03:46.379
- [squeals]
I love you.
- [尖叫声]
我爱你。

03:46.448 --> 03:51.103
- But first, you need to learn
the "basics" of being a ghost.
- 但首先你需要学习
成为鬼魂的“基础”。

03:51.172 --> 03:53.482
both: [laughs]
两人：[笑]

03:53.551 --> 03:55.689
[bell gongs]
- [grunts, babbles]
[钟锣]
- [咕哝声，胡言乱语]

03:55.758 --> 03:57.827
First lesson...
[wolf howls]
第一课...
[狼嚎]

03:57.896 --> 04:00.931
Shape-shifting.
变形。

04:01.000 --> 04:03.448
Shape-shifting is one
of the easiest things
变形是其中之一
最简单的事情

04:03.517 --> 04:05.241
a ghost can do.
鬼也能做到。

04:05.310 --> 04:08.965
You just have to think
of a horrible thing and poof!
你只需要思考
一件可怕的事情，噗！

04:09.034 --> 04:10.758
[screams]
[尖叫声]

04:10.827 --> 04:12.620
[snake hisses]
[bat squeaks]
[蛇嘶嘶声]
[蝙蝠吱吱声]

04:12.689 --> 04:15.034
[in Pearl's voice]
You become it!
[珍珠的声音]
你就成为它！

04:15.103 --> 04:16.586
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

04:16.655 --> 04:19.172
- Now, you try.
- 现在，你试试。

04:19.241 --> 04:21.275
- Hm...
- 嗯...

04:21.344 --> 04:23.620
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:23.689 --> 04:25.965
[chicken clucking]
I did it!
[鸡咯咯叫]
我做到了！

04:26.034 --> 04:28.206
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

04:28.275 --> 04:29.931
That's not horrible.
那并不可怕。

04:30.000 --> 04:32.344
What were you thinking?
Bad ghost!
你在想什么？
坏鬼！

04:32.413 --> 04:33.896
Bad!
- [groans]
坏的！
- [呻吟]

04:33.965 --> 04:36.275
[coughs]
[咳嗽]

04:36.344 --> 04:39.379
- Hmm.
Now, that's horrible!
- 唔。
现在，这太可怕了！

04:39.448 --> 04:42.137
- Now can you teach me
how to pick things up?
- 现在你能教我吗
如何拾取东西？

04:42.206 --> 04:44.413
- Not yet.
- 还没有。

04:44.482 --> 04:45.965
- Hm?
[grunts]
- 嗯？
[咕哝]

04:46.034 --> 04:48.206
[babbles]
[胡言乱语]

04:48.275 --> 04:51.137
- Next lesson, scaring.
- 下一课，吓人。

04:51.206 --> 04:53.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:53.448 --> 04:55.275
Pay close attention, squirt.
仔细点，喷。

04:55.344 --> 04:57.517
This is how you scare someone.
这就是你吓唬别人的方式。

04:57.586 --> 04:59.034
- [chuckles mischievously]
- [cackling]
- [顽皮地笑]
- [咯咯笑]

04:59.103 --> 05:01.793
[cat shrieking]
Huh?
[猫尖叫声]
啊？

05:01.862 --> 05:02.896
Hm...
嗯...

05:02.965 --> 05:04.344
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

05:04.413 --> 05:07.379
- [shrieks]
- [尖叫]

05:07.448 --> 05:09.586
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

05:09.655 --> 05:11.620
- Okay, my turn.
- 好吧，轮到我了。

05:11.689 --> 05:13.172
- [grunts softly]
- [轻声咕哝]

05:13.241 --> 05:15.344
- Shh.
Someone's coming.
- 嘘。
有人来了。

05:15.413 --> 05:19.137
Watch me scare this dummy
real good.
看我吓唬这个假人
真的很好。

05:19.206 --> 05:21.965
[screams]
[thunder booms]
[尖叫声]
[雷霆轰鸣]

05:22.034 --> 05:25.000
[shrieks]
[尖叫声]

05:25.068 --> 05:27.172
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

05:27.241 --> 05:29.137
- Well, you scared yourself.
- 好吧，你吓到自己了。

05:29.206 --> 05:31.206
I guess that counts.
我想这很重要。

05:31.275 --> 05:32.620
Next lesson.
下一课。

05:32.689 --> 05:35.689
- [shouts, whimpers]
- [喊叫，呜咽]

05:35.758 --> 05:39.068
- Haunting houses.
- 鬼屋。

05:39.137 --> 05:40.965
[thunder booms]
[雷霆轰鸣]

05:41.034 --> 05:43.000
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

05:43.068 --> 05:46.724
- All right, pupil, it's time
to apply all you've learned
- 好吧，学生，时间到了
运用你所学到的一切

05:46.793 --> 05:49.310
and frighten
this guy's legs off.
并吓唬
这家伙的腿断了。

05:49.379 --> 05:52.172
- With pleasure.
- 荣幸。

05:52.241 --> 05:53.482
- Eh.
- 呃。

05:53.551 --> 05:55.931
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:56.000 --> 05:57.586
[murmurs]
[低语]

05:57.655 --> 06:00.172
[chuckles evilly]
[邪恶地笑]

06:00.241 --> 06:02.586
- [screams]
Who's there?
- [尖叫]
谁在那里？

06:02.655 --> 06:04.896
Ohh, is that you, SpongeBob?
哦，是你吗，海绵宝宝？

06:04.965 --> 06:06.275
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

06:06.344 --> 06:08.275
[gargles]
[漱口]

06:08.344 --> 06:10.137
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

06:10.206 --> 06:11.275
[gasps]
[喘气]

06:11.344 --> 06:12.724
[screams]
[尖叫声]

06:12.793 --> 06:14.413
- [grunts, babbles]
- [咕哝声，胡言乱语]

06:14.482 --> 06:16.103
- [low groan]
- [低声呻吟]

06:16.172 --> 06:17.586
[screams]
[尖叫声]

06:17.655 --> 06:19.482
[screaming]
[尖叫]

06:19.551 --> 06:21.275
[babbles]
[胡言乱语]

06:21.344 --> 06:23.034
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

06:23.103 --> 06:24.551
- Oooh.
- 哦。

06:24.620 --> 06:27.103
Monster mouth with
a bucket of ghost goo--
怪物嘴与
一桶幽灵粘液——

06:27.172 --> 06:28.620
very good marks.
非常好的分数。

06:28.689 --> 06:31.275
[chuckles] Nice haunt, swabby!
[轻笑] 好地方，拭目以待！

06:31.344 --> 06:35.103
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

06:35.172 --> 06:38.827
[panting]
Oh, what a terrible nightmare.
[气喘吁吁]
噢，真是一场可怕的噩梦。

06:38.896 --> 06:41.827
Oh, thanks for
being here, Clarry.
哦，谢谢你
在这里，克拉里。

06:41.896 --> 06:45.172
You'll keep the monsters away.
[inhales]
你会让怪物远离你。
[吸气]

06:45.241 --> 06:46.482
[lively tune playing]
【欢快的曲调演奏】

06:46.551 --> 06:49.517
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

06:49.586 --> 06:50.965
- Give me that!
- 给我那个！

06:51.034 --> 06:52.655
- Clarry!
[dramatic music]
- 克拉里！
[戏剧音乐]

06:52.724 --> 06:55.724
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

06:55.793 --> 06:57.448
- [imitates SpongeBob's laugh]
- [模仿海绵宝宝的笑声]

06:57.517 --> 07:00.586
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

07:00.655 --> 07:03.206
- [laughing continues]
- [笑声继续]

07:03.275 --> 07:04.379
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

07:04.448 --> 07:07.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:07.965 --> 07:10.517
[jaunty clarinet tune]
[欢快的单簧管曲调]

07:10.586 --> 07:12.551
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

07:12.620 --> 07:15.241
- Hey, I picked something up!
- 嘿，我捡到东西了！

07:15.310 --> 07:17.344
I can pick things up!
[vase crashes]
我可以捡东西！
[花瓶崩溃]

07:17.413 --> 07:18.862
- Look at you.
- 看看你。

07:18.931 --> 07:21.448
You skipped ahead
to the last lesson.
你跳过了前面
到最后一课。

07:21.517 --> 07:23.310
- It's okay.
You don't have to--
- 没关系。
你不必——

07:23.379 --> 07:25.655
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:25.724 --> 07:27.896
- Last lesson!
- 最后一课！

07:27.965 --> 07:30.413
How to pick things up.
怎么捡东西。

07:30.482 --> 07:33.827
[eerie music]
[诡异的音乐]

07:33.896 --> 07:36.689
As you discovered,
to pick things up,
正如你发现的那样，
去捡东西，

07:36.758 --> 07:41.241
you gotta get really angry!
你一定要生气！

07:41.310 --> 07:44.551
- Why didn't you say that
in the first place, moron?
-你为什么不这么说
首先，白痴？

07:44.620 --> 07:47.103
- I have nothing
left to teach you.
- 我什么都没有
留下来教你。

07:47.172 --> 07:48.896
- Oh, yeah?
- 哦，是吗？

07:48.965 --> 07:50.068
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

07:50.137 --> 07:51.896
[babbles]
[胡言乱语]

07:51.965 --> 07:54.344
[sniffling]
[emotional violin music]
[抽鼻子]
【情感小提琴音乐】

07:54.413 --> 07:56.758
My boy.
我的男孩。

07:56.827 --> 07:58.241
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

07:58.310 --> 07:59.551
- [laughs]
- [笑]

07:59.620 --> 08:01.068
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:01.137 --> 08:04.241
Oh, I'm really angry.
Here we go.
哦，我真的很生气。
开始了。

08:04.310 --> 08:05.413
Yup.
是的。

08:05.482 --> 08:08.482
[babbling]
[胡说]

08:08.551 --> 08:09.793
Ah, ah.
Oh.
啊，啊。
哦。

08:09.862 --> 08:12.103
Oh!
[laughs]
哦！
[笑]

08:12.172 --> 08:15.379
[grunting]
[bottle clanking]
[咕噜声]
[瓶子叮当作响]

08:15.448 --> 08:18.862
Blasted bottle!
It's always something!
瓶子被炸了！
总是有一些东西！

08:18.931 --> 08:21.241
- [laughs]
- What?
- [笑]
- 什么？

08:21.310 --> 08:25.000
- Guess you didn't think that
one through all the way, did ya?
- 我猜你没想到
一路走来，是吗？

08:25.068 --> 08:26.241
- Dead jerk.
- 死混蛋。

08:26.310 --> 08:29.758
- [laughing]
- [笑]

08:29.827 --> 08:31.620
- Well, I'm calling it.
- 嗯，我正在打电话。

08:31.689 --> 08:33.965
This ghost racket
is for the birds.
这鬼球拍
是给鸟儿的。

08:34.034 --> 08:37.137
I'm going back to my body
where I belong.
我要回到我的身体
我属于哪里。

08:37.206 --> 08:38.620
Hmph!
哼！

08:38.689 --> 08:40.275
- Hmm...
- 唔...

08:40.344 --> 08:41.620
- Huh?
- 啊？

08:41.689 --> 08:45.137
I don't remember
leaving the lights on.
我不记得了
让灯开着。

08:45.206 --> 08:46.724
Wha--huh?
什——啊？

08:46.793 --> 08:48.310
[somber music]
[忧郁的音乐]

08:48.379 --> 08:49.517
[indistinct chatter]
[模糊的喋喋不休]

08:49.586 --> 08:51.034
Yeesh.
是啊。

08:51.103 --> 08:52.758
You can't leave
your own carcass alone
你不能离开
唯有你自己的尸体

08:52.827 --> 08:54.758
for ten minutes in this town!
在这个小镇待十分钟！

08:54.827 --> 08:57.137
- And now,
if anyone has anything
- 现在，
如果有人有什么

08:57.206 --> 09:00.793
nice to say about Sheldon,
this would be the time.
很高兴地说谢尔顿，
现在就是时候了。

09:00.862 --> 09:03.586
- [snickers]
- Shh.
- [窃笑]
- 嘘。

09:03.655 --> 09:05.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:05.965 --> 09:08.482
- Um, Plankton was small and...
[sniffs]
- 嗯，浮游生物很小而且......
[嗅嗅]

09:08.551 --> 09:11.310
And green and loud!
又绿又响亮！

09:11.379 --> 09:14.517
[sobbing hysterically]
[歇斯底里地抽泣]

09:14.586 --> 09:17.034
- All right, come on.
- 好吧，来吧。

09:17.103 --> 09:18.551
It's okay.
没关系。

09:18.620 --> 09:20.172
- Yeesh.
- 是的。

09:20.241 --> 09:24.344
This is the worst funeral
of mine I've ever been to.
这是最糟糕的葬礼
我曾经去过的。

09:24.413 --> 09:27.793
But watch these idiots scream
when I get back in my body
但看看这些白痴尖叫
当我回到我的身体时

09:27.862 --> 09:29.551
and jump out of that coffin.
然后跳出棺材。

09:29.620 --> 09:31.758
- [cackles]
- [咯咯笑]

09:31.827 --> 09:33.931
Ya can't go back
in your body now.
雅无法回去
现在在你的身体里。

09:34.000 --> 09:35.931
You're dead, ya dodo!
你死定了，渡渡鸟！

09:36.000 --> 09:40.103
- I'm not dead.
I'm just a temporary ghost.
- 我没有死。
我只是一个暂时的幽灵。

09:40.172 --> 09:43.241
My body is in suspended
animation, that's all.
我的身体处于悬浮状态
动画，仅此而已。

09:43.310 --> 09:45.275
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

09:45.344 --> 09:46.586
[tense music]
[紧张的音乐]

09:46.655 --> 09:49.758
You mean,
this is an empty vessel?
你的意思是，
这是一个空容器？

09:49.827 --> 09:52.241
I haven't possessed
a body in years!
我还没有拥有过
多年的身体！

09:52.310 --> 09:55.448
- You can't do that!
That's my body!
- 你不能那样做！
那是我的身体！

09:55.517 --> 09:57.482
- Not anymore!
- 不再！

09:57.551 --> 09:59.344
- [whimpers] Huh?
- [laughs]
- [呜咽] 嗯？
- [笑]

09:59.413 --> 10:02.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:02.103 --> 10:03.931
Rarg!
I'm alive!
拉格！
我还活着！

10:04.000 --> 10:05.379
It's great to be back!
回来真是太好了！

10:05.448 --> 10:07.241
all: [gasp]
- Oh!
全体：[喘气]
- 哦！

10:07.310 --> 10:09.793
- No!
- 不！

10:09.862 --> 10:12.620
- [giggles]
Ta-da!
- [咯咯笑]
哒哒！

10:12.689 --> 10:15.758
- [sniffles]
Plankton's alive?
- [抽鼻子]
浮游生物还活着吗？

10:15.827 --> 10:17.758
Hooray!
[yelps]
万岁！
[尖叫声]

10:17.827 --> 10:19.344
- I knew it!
- 我就知道！

10:19.413 --> 10:21.862
- He's alive?
[overlapping angry chatter]
- 他还活着吗？
[重叠的愤怒的喋喋不休]

10:21.931 --> 10:24.206
- Let's squash him!
- 我们来压扁他吧！

10:24.275 --> 10:26.068
all: [shouting angrily]
- ♪ Dee, dee, dee, dee ♪
全体：[愤怒地大喊]
- ♪ 迪伊，迪伊，迪伊，迪伊 ♪

10:26.137 --> 10:27.689
♪ Da, da, dee, dee, dee, da ♪
♪ 达，达，迪，迪，迪，达 ♪

10:27.758 --> 10:30.586
Wuh-oh.
[screams]
呃哦。
[尖叫声]

10:30.655 --> 10:32.896
Eh?
Reowr?
呃？
重新写？

10:32.965 --> 10:34.413
all: [growling]
全体：[咆哮]

10:34.482 --> 10:36.862
- [yelping]
- [尖叫]

10:36.931 --> 10:38.310
[whimpers, yelps]
[呜咽，尖叫]

10:38.379 --> 10:39.586
- Oh!
- 哦！

10:39.655 --> 10:41.448
I can't watch them
do that to me!
我无法看着他们
那样对我！

10:41.517 --> 10:44.275
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

10:44.344 --> 10:46.034
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:46.103 --> 10:47.517
[grunts]
[咕哝]

10:47.586 --> 10:49.724
Here!
Take it.
这里！
拿走吧。

10:49.793 --> 10:52.068
Those people are angry.
Whew!
那些人很生气。
哇！

10:52.137 --> 10:53.862
I never thought I'd say this,
我从没想过我会说出这样的话

10:53.931 --> 10:57.206
but I'd rather be a dead me
than an alive you.
但我宁愿做一个死去的我
比一个活着的你

10:57.275 --> 10:58.379
Bye!
再见！

10:58.448 --> 11:00.517
[yips]
[哎呀]

11:00.586 --> 11:04.620
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

11:04.689 --> 11:07.793
[groaning, grunting]
[呻吟，咕哝]

11:09.896 --> 11:13.275
[sighs]
My body feels great!
[叹气]
我的身体感觉棒极了！

11:13.344 --> 11:15.586
- There he is!
all: [growl]
- 他在那儿！
全体：[咆哮]

11:15.655 --> 11:17.379
- [whimpers]
[laughs]
- [呜咽]
[笑]

11:17.448 --> 11:19.172
Hey, everybody.
[nervous laugh]
嘿，大家。
[紧张的笑声]

11:19.241 --> 11:21.862
Uh, who wants to hear
a ghost story, huh?
呃 谁想听
鬼故事吧？

11:21.931 --> 11:24.517
[laughs] Anyone?
[笑]有人吗？

11:24.586 --> 11:27.000
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

11:27.068 --> 11:28.793
You know something?
Ooh!
你知道什么吗？
哦！

11:28.862 --> 11:31.344
[grunting]
It's great to be alive.
[咕噜声]
能活着真是太好了。

11:31.413 --> 11:33.034
[grunts, groans]
[咕哝声，呻吟声]

11:33.103 --> 11:35.103
[grunting] Ouch!
[yelps]
[哼哼]哎哟！
[尖叫声]

11:35.172 --> 11:35.931
[laughs]
[笑]

11:36.000 --> 11:38.482
- The end!
- 结束！

11:38.551 --> 11:40.551
[screams]
[尖叫声]

11:40.620 --> 11:42.793
[laughs]
[笑]

[笑]